      "message": "Okay.  I think we need to provide a more specific ordering.  We can do that by specializing std::less, rather than implementing operator\u003c.  The STL containers/functions actually use std::less by default, but the default std::less implementation uses operator\u003c.  So specializing std::less effectively \"overrides\" operator\u003c for STL containers/functions.",
